Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "PedestrianCrossingInFog" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Pedestrian crossing road from behind vehicle" .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Pedestrian crossing in front of vehicle with limited visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Fog reducing visibility of pedestrian and surroundings" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.8"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Pedestrian crossing in front of vehicle with limited visibility
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Fog reducing visibility of pedestrian and surroundings
Severity Score: 0.8